BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230622T062038Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nGMC Career Journey Sharing\nSynopsis\n:\nBe inspired 
	by our GMC leaders as they share their personal career journeys\, the high
	s (and lows!). More importantly\, how they adopted a growth mindset to ste
	p out of their comfort zone and embrace new challenges.\nSpeaker\n:\nSG: K
	wee Juan HAN\nCN: Him Chuan LIM\; Ginger Sze Ching CHENG\nTW: Sier Han NG 
	\nModerator\n \nShalene Chiae Chee LIM\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\
	n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre
	 Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webe
	x)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, yo
	u must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs
	1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZB
	NJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This w
	ill install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streami
	ng experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webe
	x Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38e206
	605d89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address
	 and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex 
	Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeti
	ng & Input Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJo
	in via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3
	018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-4
	0-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal call
	-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e676867362e01
	73666ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230719T145000
